## `/restack-stressor import <file> [sheet]`

Import an existing matrix from Excel or CSV — first column stressors,
remaining columns actors, binary values, header row of actor names.

1. Read via the `/restack-excel` helper.
2. Validate the shape and report any non-binary values rather than coercing
   them silently.
3. Convert and write to `docs/stressor-analysis/`.
4. **Flag the provenance.** An imported matrix has columns that were not
   derived from a walk. Say so, and treat the actor set as unverified until the
   paths behind it are walked — otherwise the analysis inherits whatever the
   original author got wrong.

